<title>NETHERLANDS: Getronics 1996 net rises 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Getronics 1996 net rises 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.52 vs   1.14</p>
<p>    Net profit			    131.6 vs  97.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.30 vs   0.25</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.21 vs   1.70</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    181.3 vs 143.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income		 11.6 vs  13.5</p>
<p>    Tax					56.1 vs  53.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected computer networks and engineering firm Getronics NV to report a net profit of 131 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
